{"unit_id":"HOPE-LGNF__dsh-state-notifier#card-zh","repo":"HOPE-LGNF/dsh-state-notifier","commit":"6713da77c80a39707ac24d3ca5d92ef500713278","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-state-notifier（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 会话提供任务状态提醒。它监听会话事件、目标状态和 Agent 错误，并通过 Web 面板订阅通知；浏览器可播放本机合成音、发送桌面通知，也可在浏览器未就绪时使用终端 BEL。主要提醒任务完成、等待审批、等待回答、受阻和出错，并支持按类别开关、设置完成提醒门槛、选择声音方案及调整通知外观。Windows 或 WSL 可选启用原生系统通知。适合希望离开页面时仍能留意 DSH 任务状态的用户。使用需兼容范围内的 DSH；原生通道无需密钥，且默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:8-20","src/index.js:70-100"]}
{"unit_id":"HOPE-LGNF__dsh-state-notifier#card-en","repo":"HOPE-LGNF/dsh-state-notifier","commit":"6713da77c80a39707ac24d3ca5d92ef500713278","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-state-notifier alerts DSH users to completed, blocked, or failed tasks, approvals, and questions. Browser notices and sounds are primary; desktop notifications and terminal BEL are supported. Configure event switches and sounds. Optional Windows and WSL alerts are off. No API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:8-20","src/index.js:70-100"]}
